    <briefdescription>
<para>Bundles the mutable ledger view and the transaction being applied. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Passed together to avoid threading two separate parameters through every helper that needs both the view (for state reads/writes) and the transaction (for field inspection and metadata).</para>
<para>Both members are non-owning references; the caller is responsible for ensuring that the referenced objects outlive the <ref refid="structxrpl_1_1ApplyViewContext" kindref="compound">ApplyViewContext</ref>.</para>
<para>TODO: replace with <ref refid="classxrpl_1_1ApplyContext" kindref="compound">ApplyContext</ref> after it&apos;s untangled with xrpl/tx </para>
    </detaileddescription>
